---
import PageShell from '../../../layouts/PageShell.astro';

const seoTitle = 'Google Business Profile Checklist | Med Spa Marketing Guide';
const seoDesc =
	'Operational sweep list for GBP accuracy: services, visuals, Attributes, Messaging policies, escalation paths—not for legal counsel.';
---

<PageShell title={seoTitle} description={seoDesc}>
	<h1>Google Business Profile checklist (template)</h1>
	<p>
		Treat GBP as parity with sterile instrument trays: inaccuracies compound distrust instantly. Customize per brand book and
		credentialing workflows.
	</p>
	<h2>Structural integrity</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Primary category aligns with supervising scope—not aspirational modalities.</li>
		<li>Secondary categories reflect ancillary revenue ethically.</li>
		<li>Service names reuse patient language synced with onsite H1 synonyms.</li>
	</ul>
	<h2>Operational realism</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Holiday / temporary hour adjustments logged centrally.</li>
		<li>Chat / SMS switches tested after vendor migrations.</li>
		<li>Photo rotation schedule with responsible owner + HIPAA guardrails.</li>
	</ul>
</PageShell>
